    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG O'DWYER HAVE THE PLEASURE IN BRINGING TO THE MARKET THIS WONDERFUL AND SPACIOUS 4 BEDROOM DETACHED DORMER BUNGALOW ON 0.64 ACRES. LOCATED JUST OFF THE CAVAN/DUBLIN RD."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 5.0m x 2.9m\n\n\nSitting Room - 5.0m x 4.4m\n\n\nKitchen/Dining/Living room - 8.2m x 4.0m\n\n\nUtility Room - 2.2m x 2.0m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.0m x 3.7m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.8m x 1.8m\n\n\nLanding - 5.0m x 2.6m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 5.0m x 3.7m\n\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.8m x 1.8m\n\n\nWalk in Wardrobe - 1.8m x 1.8m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.6m x 2.9m\n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.3m x 4.0m\n\n\nBathroom - 3.5m x 1.8m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> This charming dormer bungalow, nestled on a spacious 0.64-acre site in the serene countryside of Lavey in the outskirts of Ballyjamesduff town, offers a perfect blend of modern comfort and homely warmth.</li><li> Boasting approximately 182 square metres of well-maintained living space, the property features four generous bedrooms, three bathrooms, and two inviting reception rooms, ideal for both family living and entertaining.</li><li> The property is located in a rural location within picturesque countryside yet only 1.5km off the Main Cavan/Dublin Rd. (N3).</li><li> The towns of Ballyjamesduff, Virginia and Cavan are located 6.2km, 14.8km and 17.6km respectively from the property.</li><li> Bright and airy interiors complement the peaceful rural setting, creating a welcoming atmosphere throughout. The dwelling is set amidst mature hedging and shrubbery with stunning landscaped gardens with a south-west facing rear garden providing an abundance of natural light and a delightful space for outdoor relaxation for gardening enthusiasts.</li><li> The outdoor space has also been capitalised with the additional of an expansive deck off the kitchen that extends to an enclosed outdoor space for relaxation</li><li> The property is approached with a sweeping tarmac driveway.</li><li> 16 no. PV panels installed to roof</li><li> EV charger installed</li><li> Alarm system installed</li><li> Oil Fired Central Heating</li><li> Group water scheme supply</li><li> Biocycle sewerage system</li><li> Year of construction : 2004</li><li> This comfortable and spacious home epitomises country living with modern amenities, making it an excellent choice for those seeking tranquillity without compromising on comfort.</li><li> The property's well-kept condition means it is ready to welcome its new owners to enjoy the idyllic lifestyle on offer.</li><li> Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this delightful home provides.</ul>"
      },
      {
